{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Running UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an exciting parkour adventure in Running UP \u2014 a simple yet challenging game that delivers a straightforward but thrilling experience. Test your reflexes, timing, and determination as you climb higher with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Running UP, the goal is simple: run, jump, and climb to reach each level. Every attempt counts, making the gameplay intense and rewarding. The minimalist design keeps the focus on pure gameplay, offering fast-paced parkour fun for players who enjoy a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Yet Engaging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn but difficult to master. Ideal for quick sessions or extended play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is carefully designed with jumps, platforms, and obstacles that test your skills and push you to improve with every try</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408300?t=1768331048","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408300?t=1768331048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408300/753da4adc7782c45ef481b7279f8b75ea17f7c4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768331048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408300/753da4adc7782c45ef481b7279f8b75ea17f7c4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768331048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Running UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an exciting parkour adventure in Running UP \u2014 a simple yet challenging game that delivers a straightforward but thrilling experience. Test your reflexes, timing, and determination as you climb higher with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Running UP, the goal is simple: run, jump, and climb to reach each level. Every attempt counts, making the gameplay intense and rewarding. The minimalist design keeps the focus on pure gameplay, offering fast-paced parkour fun for players who enjoy a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Yet Engaging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn but difficult to master. Ideal for quick sessions or extended play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is carefully designed with jumps, platforms, and obstacles that test your skills and push you to improve with every try</p>","developers":["Ridac Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408300/dd7be0451039e951b5bea7e5a65219556a92bf1d/header.jpg?t=1768331048","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3408300/508944844/ee9b965d8bb8ac8c0fe83cf9b8902f54de645320/1768324989/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768326181","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3408300/508944844/ee9b965d8bb8ac8c0fe83cf9b8902f54de645320/1768324989/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768326181","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3408300/508944844/ee9b965d8bb8ac8c0fe83cf9b8902f54de645320/1768324989/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768326181","id